	<li><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>Exhibits demeanor which is appropriate for the situation.</span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>Functions well as a team member.</span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>Responds to others using tact and diplomacy.</span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>Provides guidance, direction, leadership and motivation to assisting agents, analysts and others as applicable.</span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>Displays ethical and responsible behavior.</span></span></span></li>
